# KernelSU / Magisk sepolicy additions, applied at boot.
#
# Deliberately empty. Everything this module does runs from the root shell in
# the su domain, which already has the access it needs for /data/adb and
# /data/system/dropbox. Adding broad rules here would widen the kernel policy
# for no functional gain.
#
# If a future check needs extra access, add the narrowest rule that works and
# document why, e.g.:
#   allow su system_data_file dir { search write add_name remove_name }
